<title>ECUADOR: Bad Ecuadorean bank debt up 30.4 pct Apr vs Apr.</title>
<headline>Bad Ecuadorean bank debt up 30.4 pct Apr vs Apr.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The bad debt portfolio of Ecuadorean banks was $401 million in April, 30.4 percent higher than in the same month last year, the Central Bank said Friday.</p>
<p>Total bank loans were $4.1 billion, up 22.9 percent from April last year.</p>
<p>((--Franz Bastidas, Quito Newsroom +5932 258429))</p>
</text>
